iscuss other candidates next.\n\nWe need to reference existing discussion: none, but we can say \"I will start by presenting my view\". That's okay.\n\nProvide evidence: anticipate dangerous situations, excellent spatial vision, leadership; concerns: show-off, not open to new ideas.\n\nNow produce output."}
